1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 12=

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,039
I'm dead.

6
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:11,640
He'll freeze my cards and make me kneel.

7
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,199
Sir.

8
00:00:13,759 --> 00:00:14,800
It's a misunderstanding.

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:15,599
A mistake.

10
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:16,199
Listen, kid.

11
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:17,519
Know what's good for you.

12
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:19,280
Know what's good for you.

13
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,160
We're leaving.

14
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:20,920
Sorry. We're sorry.

15
00:00:21,079 --> 00:00:21,800
We'll go right now.

16
00:00:22,039 --> 00:00:23,000
- Let's go.
- We're leaving.

17
00:00:27,839 --> 00:00:28,600
Mr. Xie,

18
00:00:29,519 --> 00:00:31,000
please don't blame Bao'er.

19
00:00:31,399 --> 00:00:33,200
She was protecting me, so...

20
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,000
No!

21
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,000
I wanted to teach those two a lesson.

22
00:00:37,159 --> 00:00:38,520
Hua had nothing to do with it.

23
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:39,960
It was me.

24
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,200
No.

25
00:00:41,560 --> 00:00:42,960
I'm the one who brought you here.

26
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,520
This is all my fault.

27
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,600
You were standing up for me,

28
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,079
so it's my responsibility.

29
00:00:54,439 --> 00:00:55,520
You two look after Bao'er.

30
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,240
How romantic.

31
00:00:59,359 --> 00:00:59,920
Yeah.

32
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:04,239
Mr. Zeng,

33
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:06,959
I...

34
00:01:07,599 --> 00:01:09,319
Dad didn't punish me.

35
00:01:10,879 --> 00:01:12,280
He even told you two to look after me.

36
00:01:13,959 --> 00:01:15,200
He's busy with your stepmom.

37
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,079
No time to punish you.

38
00:01:35,079 --> 00:01:35,439
No need.

39
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,359
I... I can do it.

40
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,200
Wait here.

41
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:16,520
Does it hurt?

42
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,400
Not too much.

43
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:29,040
♪I should give myself a break♪

44
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:32,100
♪That's just science in my head♪

45
00:02:32,100 --> 00:02:35,080
♪And I cannot find it♪

46
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,800
♪Every night we almost say it♪

47
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:42,600
♪But the moments don't feel right♪

48
00:02:42,880 --> 00:02:45,040
♪So we roll♪

49
00:02:45,040 --> 00:02:47,900
♪We roll and fantasize♪

50
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,720
♪of a better time♪

51
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,240
You had a scare tonight.

52
00:02:52,759 --> 00:02:53,199
I'm sorry.

53
00:02:55,719 --> 00:02:56,199
No.

54
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,319
I'm fine, Mr. Xie.

55
00:02:59,400 --> 00:03:00,560
It wasn't your fault.

56
00:03:01,039 --> 00:03:02,120
In the Xie family,

57
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:03,479
the most important thing

58
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,560
is looking out for our own.

59
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,080
Bao'er did nothing wrong.

60
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:17,360
Thank you.

61
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,400
What for?

62
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:21,599
Thank you

63
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:23,520
for always being there.

64
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,039
I always will be.

65
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,560
The figures for this project

66
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:57,560
are way off.

67
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,680
The load calculations
are off by over 15%.

68
00:04:00,039 --> 00:04:01,080
If we'd submitted this,

69
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:03,120
our department's reputation
would be ruined.

70
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:05,719
Who's responsible?

71
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,000
I am.

72
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,160
You have three days.

73
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,560
Go to Gu Group in person

74
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,120
and get them to sign off on it.

75
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,079
Yes, sir.

76
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,639
Bei Ruo, I'm sorry.

77
00:04:37,279 --> 00:04:38,639
I got the figures wrong.

78
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,399
I'll tell the director it was me.

79
00:04:41,279 --> 00:04:41,839
Don't.

80
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,759
I've already taken responsibility.

81
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:45,000
Besides,

82
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:47,040
you've got a lot going on at home.

83
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,439
Your husband's sick,

84
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,600
and your kids and parents need you.

85
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,240
Don't risk losing your job.

86
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:55,000
You didn't have to cover for her.

87
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,360
That's work for you.

88
00:04:58,959 --> 00:04:59,519
I can handle it.

89
00:05:01,399 --> 00:05:01,879
Hu,

90
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:02,879
after work,

91
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,639
go home and look after your family.

92
00:05:05,199 --> 00:05:07,000
Leave this to me.

93
00:05:07,639 --> 00:05:08,279
Thank you.

94
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:10,920
Let's get back to work.

95
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:18,160
Lin Hua,

96
00:05:18,839 --> 00:05:20,560
please help me.

97
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,399
People have been saying

98
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:26,040
you and Gu Group's heir
are childhood sweethearts.

99
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,439
I think

100
00:05:27,839 --> 00:05:28,879
you're the only one who can help me.

101
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:29,800
I...

102
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:32,160
Please.

103
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:33,560
Help me.

104
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:52,960
♪You say you♪

105
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:54,960
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

106
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:58,360
♪You're just fine on your own♪

107
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:01,520
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

108
00:06:01,640 --> 00:06:04,520
♪And the pain you face at night♪

109
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:08,200
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

110
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:11,360
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

111
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:14,440
♪Some love needs no promises♪

112
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:17,800
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

113
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:20,480
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

114
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:23,720
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

115
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:26,680
♪I'm right behind you♪

116
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:30,200
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

117
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:32,840
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

118
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:36,840
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

119
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:43,040
♪I'm right behind you♪

120
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:44,920
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

121
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:46,760
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

122
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:49,200
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

123
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:50,760
♪I'm right behind you♪

124
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:53,120
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

125
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,880
♪I won't claim you♪

126
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,560
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

127
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:59,240
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

128
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:02,600
♪Waiting for you♪
